      <title>新墨西哥州最大水库跌至容量的1.4% 令格兰德河水资源告急</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/climate/post/20260910/%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%A8%E8%A5%BF%E5%93%A5%E5%B7%9E%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E6%B0%B4%E5%BA%93%E8%B7%8C%E8%87%B3%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%841.4-%E4%BB%A4%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%B0%E5%BE%B7%E6%B2%B3%E6%B0%B4%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%91%8A%E6%80%A5/</link>
